WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.790
Noon, on a roof in Joppa.

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.300
Peter is hungry.

3
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:09.070
He sees a sheet let down, holding
animals that Jewish food laws forbid.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.180
A voice says: Rise, Peter, kill and eat.

5
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.590
He refuses.

6
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.630
It happens three times.

7
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.460
Meanwhile, about 50 kilometres
up the coast in Caesarea,

8
00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.500
a Roman centurion is told to send for him.

9
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:26.970
So what did the vision of
forbidden food really mean?

10
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:31.140
In this mission, you'll compare Peter's
preaching in Jerusalem with what happens

11
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:33.020
in a Roman officer's house.

12
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.320
Then you'll follow Peter to
a tense meeting in Jerusalem,

13
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.560
and to a prison cell
where his chains fall off.

14
00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:43.150
Your mission: find out what
Peter's vision really meant.
